+# Dated Judiciary addendum — correction of a stale-byte evidence claim (cycle `ee037ddab870918de8a4fe9d9508ad68`)
+
+Recorded 2026-11-25T14:24Z. Append-only; preserves the original report and the
+filed case outcome unchanged. No law, audit verdict, correction trail, case
+state, activation or productive ownership was changed. No reform is proposed.
+
+## Prior report corrected
+
+`records/JUDICIARY-REPORT-2026-11-25-cycle-ee037ddab8-sampled-evidence.md`
+(section "Sampled verdicts", item 1) and the filed outcome
+`/var/lib/lubko/wd/viche-state/oversight/random/outcomes/e780850d83c2abf4a6.json`
+both describe the sampled open Act 32/34 issue as having `activation.json`
+"all-disabled". That phrase was accurate only for the **preflight staging
+snapshot**, not for the **deployed canonical bytes** at sample time.
+
